<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Enemies of Kael beware!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">December 20. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">What a week! :) 3 big kills for Darksphere, 2 of them firsts!
Well, could say all 3 was firsts, cause the Dain we nailed was v. 425, compared
to the 350 we got last week. Anyways, the pictures talk for themselves.</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kttalk.png" width="458" height="40"></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Lendi1.jpg" width="512" height="384"></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Lendi2.jpg" width="546" height="392"></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><a href="Kills/Gozzrem.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/Gozzremsmall.jpg" width="512" height="384"></a></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Lendiloot.jpg" width="115" height="196"><img border="0" src="Kills/Dainloot2.jpg" align="top" width="112" height="171"><img border="0" src="Kills/Gozzloot.jpg" align="top" width="114" height="157"></p>
<p align="center">We Hero's yet?<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="center">Grats
Laethiel and myself on<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/BeltofDwarfSlaying.jpg" width="400" height="189"><p align="center">Grats
Vikos on<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/GlovesofStability.jpg" width="400" height="189"><p align="center">Cheynar
on<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/TruesightHelm.jpg" width="401" height="190"><p align="center">Goson
on<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/RingofRelkententinar.jpg" width="400" height="190"><p align="center">and
Senya on<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/LendiniarasTalisman.jpg" width="400" height="191"><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Besides
all this, we got a Plate BP, Grats Goldmond, Plate legs x 2, plate arms x3 and
believe it or not, a Leather BP, Grats Gilli! They always seem to drop more when
Keeper is around :P<p align="left">Yelinak, here we come!


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Dain Dorfmaster!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">December 15. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Wooohooo! Finally we get a chance on this one!! :) And we all
know what that means :P Danvi was ready to do his 8th shawl saturday, and he was
kind enough to spawn dain for us doing it! :) Took a bit to get him pulled, but
it was a flawless pull, getting him to us single, for some serious arse kicking!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Dain.jpg" width="512" height="384"></p>
<p align="center">Cute, isn't he?</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Dainloot.jpg" width="114" height="244"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Goldmond and Alwayss on Aegis, Myself on his head and<br>
Goldmond again on Ring of Winter</p>
<p align="left">After that encounter we actually helped the dorfs, with the
recent loss of their king, and go Danvi his well deserved 8th shawl. Took some
time and sneaky tricks to get around VI's FUBAR'ed pathing. Grats Danvi!!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/8thShawl.jpg" width="399" height="189"></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">Just wanted to show that to ya'll! :D See ya next time</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Roar!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">December 13. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Whoa! Sorry for the no update in some time, again, I know, will
try to keep em more frequent :P&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">So what happened here? Well, think it goes a little something
like this.<p align="left">PoA, /shiver, not gonna say much or I will get a
nightmare. Keel keel keel, Grats Danvi and Nanamin on EPIC!!!!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="DanviEpic.jpg"><p align="center">WOOHOO<p align="center">Sorry
Nana, didn't get a chance to take a pic of you, remind me and I will get it
posted!<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Vindi died, 2 more times, dropped
us boots and BP, Grats Diest and Dland! Velketor died, twice, grats to all the
winners there! And that bastard finally decided to give us a nice good kill
shot! so I present to you, Velketor the Sorcerer, FULL SIZED!<p align="center"><a href="Kills/velk.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/Velksmall.jpg"></a><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/velkloot3.jpg">


<p align="center">L33T!


<p align="left">What else, what else?! I will tell you what else! NOTHING!


<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">HA, I knew you believed me there!<p align="left">Talendor
took a dirt nap (omg he was sooooo hard!) He takes 30 secs to keel, and yet
still you cant keel him in a proper place for a good killshot :P<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Talendor.jpg"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Talendorloot.jpg"><p align="center">Thanks
for the scale and Cloak of Flames!!! Sleep well, see you again!<p align="left">Red
dragon you say?! Yea, we got a white one for ya too! Gorenaire, the mother of
all pains for freshmen in DL's. /sigh. Such a joke! But still not kiteable, even
for a shaman :P Don't ask how I know.<p align="left">Again, a 30 sec keel, and
the worst killshot ever! :P<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Gore.jpg"><p align="center">WHERE
IS MY SCALE!!!! /rude ring of scale<p align="left">You want more?! I will give
you more!! Staying with the damn rotational targets, we were up for Venril
Sathir too, zzz. Time for some nerfing here VI, we want a challenge on the old
world mobs now! :P<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Venril2.jpg"><p align="center">Grats
Lothax on staff and on WIZARD EPIC!<p align="center">Kangazcon on greaves if I'm
not mistaken :P<p align="left">More? You're damn right! Remember doomshade? That
joke of a dress wearer in Umbral? Dead too! /nod. And thanks for a challen
pullers :P Bad pull resulting in the pulling of all 4 Dark Masters at once,
including 3 adds. What do you do? Well its simple, you just keel em! 10 mins
after Doomshade himself followed :P<p align="center">No keel shot that I could
find<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/LaethDSshout.jpg"><p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Doomshadeloot2.jpg"><p align="center">WHERE
IS MY BOW?! /sigh<p align="left">More?! You really want more?! OK, we wasted
these suckers too! Damn that was easy, and the worst loot ever! /sigh. But I
always enjoy killing dorfs!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Dorfs.jpg"><p align="center">WHO
IS THAT ON THE RIGHT?! Diest... a dorf?! /sigh<p align="center">Dorfs.... nuff
said<p align="center">:D<p align="left"><b>Quotes!</b><p align="left">YAY! You
finally managed to embarrass yourself enough for me to get quotes! Thank ya! :P<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/166.jpg"><p align="left">But
did he get flagged that night? ....no :P<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/167.jpg"><p align="left">Well,
if you didn't complete the first 7 shawls in 2 days, and being ready for the 8th
shawl war Saturday, I would flame you for that one. But Danvi roxxor!! Ubba
necro.<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/168.jpg"><p align="left">The
dorf squad must have taught you that :D


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Jingle bells!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">December 2. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">So we entered the month of Christmas - and yes, we're still here
;) I bet you're all eager to hear what we have been up to, so well, let's see :)</p>
<p align="left">Had a KGC rotation target, our good old friend Trakanon. What
can I say, after him displaying a perfect example of EQ path scripting, it ended
up like I prophesized last time we nailed him :P Another fugly dwagun, faced
down the dirt!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Trak2.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">/yawn</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Trak2loot.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Nemster and myself on a Jaundiced Bone BP, and
Dlandridel, Senya, Vikos and myself again, on Trak's tooth! Spell was VoG,
woooooo /rude</p>
<p align="left">We had yet another 2 run downs on PoF, ending up with no less
than 2 slime bloods! Grats Danvi and Kulack! Finally we also had our chance, to
get serious with Cazic himself, but unfortunately, he got the upper hand when we
had him down below 30. We learned alot, had alot of first time CT raiders, so he
is ours next time!</p>
<p align="left">Lcea Katta and Servitor took several more dirt naps, Lcea good
enough to drop belts for us each time, grats to all the winners! Now drop us
that mask you damn bard! Servitor was not so greedy this time, and gave us 2 FT
staffs! Thankies!</p>
<p align="left">Chardok Royals was wasted again, supplying most of our remaining
non epic clerics with their drop. Also, Vannor, our latest cleric addition and
an old face in Darksphere, completed his epic this weekend!!! GRATS VANNOR! Will
get a pic up soon asap!</p>
<p align="left">Other than that, we spend most of our time in ToV again - it's
getting easy and boring, however, when you see what it yields us, you wanna go
back for more!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="KhanToVarmor.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Khanlya to be the first all out ToV Kael armor equiped
Darksphere cleric!</p>
<p align="center">Another big grats to Diestrich, being our 3rd tank sporting
full kael! :)</p>
<p align="left">and imagine we're only 2 bp drops away from our 4th and 5th tank
too... Also, we FINALLY managed to get a Silk Robe to drop! About time!! /rude
ToV!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="ToVrobe.jpg"></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/152.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">bwahahaha</p>
<p align="left">Besides all this, we have spent the better part of the last few
weeks doing more xp and recruiting. A big warm welcome to our new members, and a
big grats to Darksphere - we raised from being a guild with an average lvl of
57, to now 61! Grats!</p>
<p align="left">And this, I got qoutes for j00!!</p>
<p align="left"><b>Christmas qoutes!</b></p>
<p align="left">Good to see some of the good old faces back in Darksphere! :)
Gonna start this one with some classics from no less than TR himself!</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/150.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">Beach boys? :P</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/151.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">sad but true :P</p>
<p align="left">And this is *still* our tank</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/153.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">Lack a ToV ally mage? no problem!</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/154.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">This is what happens when our 65 necro friend Danvi gets bored
in SF</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/155.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">No.... but I'm sure you can tell us?</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/156.jpg"></p>
<p align="left"><b>From the Cadence mansion!</b></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/157.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">I don't wanna know...</p>
<p align="left">and Award winning!</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/158.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">That's our bard! :P</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/159.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">/cheer Laethiel!</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/160.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">Yea, but I would hate to see Laeth's :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/161.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">[63 Oracle] Njall (Barbarian) &lt;Darksphere&gt; ;)</p>
<p align="left">Walls = bad. Finally someone to fix that error of VI's</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/162.jpg"></p>
<p align="left"><b>Seen in the bazaar</b></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/163.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">You put weed in those?</p>
<p align="left">Gnomes are perverts!</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/164.jpg"></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/165.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">I don't know what you are talking about, *I* don't wear kilts!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="NjallHalfling.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">[63 Oracle] Njall (Halfling) &lt;Darksphere&gt; :D</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">Untill next time kids! :P</p>
